## About the board

The National Electrical Safety Board (Elsäkerhetsverket) is responsible for electrical safety regulation in Sweden. It issues the ELSÄK-FS regulation series and supervises electrical installations, electrical products and electrical work.

## Regulations

- The Electrical Safety Act (2016:732)
- ELSÄK-FS – the board's regulations
